ng (succession chain)          | Not exercised — the sovereign-binding tier covers never-rotated keys; the `identity_file` succession tier (§8.2 step 6) is deferred until `performMigration` carries the identity file |\n\nwith exactly this line (same length, so the table's padding is unchanged):\n\n| Rotated-key binding (succession chain)          | Not exercised live — the succession tier (§8.2 step 6) is implemented (`becd04927`), but `scripts/migrate-live.ts` passes no identity file, so the run above used a never-rotated key. |\n\nChange 2. Replace these two lines, the third item under \"## The path to a full (multi-operator) proof\":\n\n3. The **rotated-key** tier: `performMigration` carries the `identity_file`; the\n   destination validates the succession chain (§8.2 step 6).\n\nwith exactly these three lines:\n\n3. The **rotated-key** tier, live: `scripts/migrate-live.ts` migrates an agent\n   whose key has rotated, passing its `identity_file`, and the destination\n   validates the succession chain (§8.2 step 6).\n"},"spec":"motebit/repo-change-bundle@1.0","tick":{"delegate_id":"ebabc222-1f74-8177-8537-30590a2808a3","delegate_public_key":"a7deb2fcddaf8370586fd7f62716a2371b38f41d878497f95942c5ef58ac6299","delegator_id":"019df0f4-084e-7910-90a8-3492ced8fb8f","delegator_public_key":"854caa5de4068766ae58b0b424752ac8883b65949def7c99d9281c9c8350a972","expires_at":1794645686594,"grant_id":"01a1d411-9d42-7f75-9806-4b338116984c","issued_at":1794559286594,"scope":"repo_read_blob,repo_write_path","signature":"Nwmt0LCKwT_7lWZhk_asvyhxCywHYrscuu-5gWBUh46_WmgWeFWbxlMbLbyy346jghI9JsWDNY6hqAOAkaJOAg","suite":"motebit-jcs-ed25519-b64-v1"},"tool_receipts":[{"args_hash":"119c3cbfc6b67185dc15fed7da99285ea436911591f1f45f8faf7f44b96e5ed5","completed_at":1794566197278,"device_id":"48b002f3-024d-4faf-8b4d-048f90f2a6a8","invocation_id":"bb2544b6-1ef3-4507-bf3b-01bdeb4f1b09","invocation_origin":"ai-loop","motebit_id":"ebabc222-1f74-8177-8537-30590a2808a3","public_key":"a7deb2fcddaf83705